                  },
                  "html": "<h3 data-font=\"sans\"> Swift - Sleeps 6</h3> <p>Swift offers colourful open plan living with a fully equipped kitchen and large dining table. The spacious master bedroom with ensuite one end and the twin rooms and family bathroom the other flank the main living area. </p>",
