                    "width": 1512,
                    "height": 915,
                    "alt": "Open-plan living room with black leather sofas and armchairs, a yellow rug, a kitchen with oak units and glazed doors to the patio"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3 data-font=\"sans\"> Partridge - Sleeps 6</h3> <p>The perfect place for a family looking for a quiet rural escape on a working farm. Step into the open-plan living room, with four-seater sofa and two tub chairs, a Smart TV and dining area, all overlooking the lovely green spaces around the farm buildings.</p>",
